@omdsh-plugins/omdsh-usage README · How it works：Almost none of the accounting is this plugin's. The session log already records
provider usage on every assembled assistant message, and the harness's
projection seam already folds and checkpoints per-session state. So:

@omdsh-plugins/omdsh-usage README · Commands：Every spec runs from a bare clone on the committed pin: the pure modules import
the harness type-only, and the two that need a snapshot store are handed one
rather than importing the browser bundle a test runner cannot load.
